{"id":"n29610-1-19","stage":1,"title":"아파트 · 公寓","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29610-1-19-1","ko":"유민아, 너도 이 아파트에 사니?","zh":"裕敏，你也住这个小区吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민아,","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"유민아","audio":"/audio/6bc140c60d405848e43c.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"너도","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아파트에","meaning":"公寓","explanation":"아파트：公寓；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"아파트","audio":"/audio/9dc94a9d71345356674e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29610","senseId":"1","lemma":"아파트","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사니?","meaning":"住，生活","explanation":"살다：住，生活；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"10","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"9dc94a9d71345356","term":"아파트","zh":"公寓","audio":"/audio/9dc94a9d71345356674e.mp3","entryId":"29610","definition":"为使多家住户可以独立地居住在同一栋高大的建筑物内而建造的住宅。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"住，生活","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"在某处居住或停留。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9fdcb580566d522decb1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29610-1-19-2","ko":"응. 지난달에 이사 왔어. 삼 동 천오백이 호에 살아.","zh":"嗯，上个月搬来的，住三栋一五〇二号。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지난달에","meaning":"过，过去；月","explanation":"지나다：过，过去；달：月；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"지나다","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3"},{"term":"달","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82142","senseId":"1","lemma":"지나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"62266","senseId":"2","lemma":"달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이사","meaning":"搬家","explanation":"이사：搬家","readings":[{"term":"이사","audio":"/audio/925efb171a8616ccc70a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71138","senseId":"1","lemma":"이사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔어.","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"삼","meaning":"三","explanation":"삼：三","readings":[{"term":"삼","audio":"/audio/3cd6c40aac5fd42ef96d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61854","senseId":"1","lemma":"삼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동","meaning":"栋，幢","explanation":"동：栋，幢","readings":[{"term":"동","audio":"/audio/70d46f8c1cc5dc7aa4df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48858","senseId":"1","lemma":"동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"천오백이","meaning":"千，一千；五；百；二","explanation":"천：千，一千；오：五；백：百；이：二","readings":[{"term":"천","audio":"/audio/b201938cc759f55752b8.mp3"},{"term":"오","audio":"/audio/c0ccf82e09f1e8734531.mp3"},{"term":"백","audio":"/audio/f30a48779ab0b5cdf1b3.mp3"},{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17167","senseId":"1","lemma":"천","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"31635","senseId":"1","lemma":"오","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"36019","senseId":"1","lemma":"백","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"71125","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"호에","meaning":"室","explanation":"호：室；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"호","audio":"/audio/37c8489e513160a7f672.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26911","senseId":"3","lemma":"호","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살아.","meaning":"住，生活","explanation":"살다：住，生活；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"10","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"7d68e3b7dc1c001c","term":"지나다","zh":"过，过去","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3","entryId":"82142","definition":"随时间流逝，脱离那个时期。","pronunciation":["지나다"]},{"id":"2f941e6eb2150679","term":"달","zh":"月","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3","entryId":"62266","definition":"把一年分为十二个的每个时间段。","pronunciation":["달"]},{"id":"925efb171a8616cc","term":"이사","zh":"搬家","audio":"/audio/925efb171a8616ccc70a.mp3","entryId":"71138","definition":"离开原先生活的地方，搬去别的地方。","pronunciation":["이사"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"3cd6c40aac5fd42e","term":"삼","zh":"三","audio":"/audio/3cd6c40aac5fd42ef96d.mp3","entryId":"61854","definition":"二加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["삼"]},{"id":"70d46f8c1cc5dc7a","term":"동","zh":"栋，幢","audio":"/a